  "description": "VEH-003 (ACR-VEH-01): shared Thai licence-plate rules. The backend (App\\Support\\Vehicles\\ThaiPlate, ThaiProvince) and the AI service (app.plates.thai) each implement these rules and both test suites check them against this file. Change it only together with both implementations.",
